WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.920
Module 7.

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.475
On-Chain Analytics.

00:00:03.475 --> 00:00:05.400
Part of Stage 3, Analyst.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.687
By the end of this module, you'll be

00:00:08.687 --> 00:00:11.995
able to read on-chain data without over-interpreting it.

00:00:11.995 --> 00:00:13.350
That's the standard.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:15.320
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:20.485
There are 9 lessons, starting with On-chain data foundations.

00:00:20.485 --> 00:00:22.464
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:22.464 --> 00:00:24.735
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:26.035 --> 00:00:27.664
If the topic is new to

00:00:27.664 --> 00:00:30.515
you, start with Mastery Starter 7.0.

00:00:30.515 --> 00:00:32.410
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:34.564
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:34.564 --> 00:00:36.695
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:36.695 --> 00:00:38.502
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:38.502 --> 00:00:40.535
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:41.835 --> 00:00:44.440
Let's begin, with lesson 7.0.
